Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 13:31:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 54/59] Forward MSE segments to the transcoder

cefMseStart() starts a MSE stream like cefStreamVideo(). The segments
are posted to <origin>/__vdrmse__/ and forwarded to the transcoder
without leaving the browser. VDR keeps the data of a MSE stream
during a pause.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5
